  {
    "id": 2003008040060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "美味しそうなものも楽しそうなものも\r\nいっぱいだよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、本当だなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "どうしよう！\r\nどのお店から寄ったらいいかなぁ……！？",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どれも悩ましいから──大きい項目から決めようか\r\nまず、遊ぶか食べるか、どっちだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "お腹が空いてるから食べたい！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "r",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040080",
    "voiceKeep": true
  },
  {
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "──んだけど……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "どこもいい匂いばっかりで……！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そこかしこからしてくるよな\r\n焼きそばとじゃがバターと……これはイカ焼きか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あーん！\r\nソースとバターとタレだ～……っ！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "せっかくだから全部食べたいよー……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "全部か……\r\nそれはなかなか手強そうだ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……お好み焼きでしょ、たこ焼きでしょ、\r\nあとポテトとか唐揚げとかも絶対美味しい！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "全部一口サイズで売ってくれたら、\r\nいろんなものが食べられるのに～っ……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "どれにしよう……！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040140"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（──真剣だな……\r\n俺も子どもの頃、よく悩んだっけ……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（──……よし）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐる、ここで取引なんてどうだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "取引……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\nめぐるに、美味しそうな屋台の案内をしてもらいたいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も何か食べたいんだけど、決めきれなくてさ\r\n代わりにめぐるに決めてほしい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "え。うん、それはいいけど……\r\nでも──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん、対価は払うから安心してくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "案内してもらったお礼に、\r\nめぐるが食べきれないと思ったものは、俺が引き受けよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー、それって……！\r\nはんぶんこしてくれるってこと……！？",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これなら、ふたりとも美味しいものを少しずつ、\r\n色々食べられるだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まぁ、わけやすいものに限られちゃうけどさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──さて、どうだろう\r\n取引は成立か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "もちろんだよっ！\r\nわーいっ、ありがとうプロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "やったやったぁ……！\r\nまずはどれにしようかなーっ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサーは、唐揚げとたこ焼きとポテトだったら\r\nどれがいい？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、だから言ってるだろ？　決めきれないんだって\r\nどれも美味しそうだし、なんでも食べられるしな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "取引は有効に使ってくれ、めぐる\r\n──全部いかなくていいのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040220,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "！　全部……！\r\nそれが許されちゃうなんて……！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040230,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "さっきのお願いが叶っちゃうよ……！\r\nすっごく魅力的……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうする？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "──じゃあじゃあ、改めて質問っ",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "唐揚げとたこ焼きとポテトだったら、\r\nどれからにしたい！？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうだな──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040260,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "実を言うとね、甘いものの候補もあるから──\r\nそれも踏まえて考えてもらえたら嬉しいな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、いいぞ\r\nちなみにそっちの候補は？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040270,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うんっ\r\nえっとね──",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003008040280,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "かき氷と人形焼きと、わたあめだよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300804/2003008040280"
  },
